msgstr "请先等待该项目正在进行的轮次结束或将其中止，再重新绑定"

#. Refusal: the draft's agent is answering, so its agent cannot change now
#: src/authoring.ts
msgid "wait for the reply before switching the agent"
msgstr "请等待回复结束后再切换智能体"

#. Refusal: the draft's agent is answering
#: src/authoring.ts
msgid "wait for the reply, or abort it, first"
msgstr "请先等待回复结束，或将其中止"

#. Refusal: the session being deleted has a turn in flight
#. Refusal: the session being deleted has a turn in flight
#: src/service.ts
#: src/store.ts
msgid "wait for the running turn to finish, or abort it, before deleting"
msgstr "请先等待正在进行的轮次结束或将其中止，再执行删除"

#. Guidance under a sync a held session stopped
#: src/space.ts
msgid "Wait for the session to finish, then Retry."
msgstr "请等待该会话结束，然后重试。"

#. What blocks a Space operation: a turn is being admitted
#: src/service.ts
msgid "Wait for the turn being submitted"
msgstr "请等待正在提交的轮次"

#. Why a compile cannot start: the draft's agent is answering
#: src/authoring.ts
msgid "Waits for the reply"
msgstr "正在等待回复"

#. Guidance after the reader stopped a transfer
#: src/space-git.ts
msgid "You stopped the transfer; your commits stand. Git runs without prompts, so a helper that prompts fails instead of hanging."
msgstr "你已停止传输；你的提交仍然有效。Git 以无交互方式运行，因此需要交互的凭据助手会直接失败，而不会一直挂起。"

#. Guidance under a push the remote rejected twice
#: src/space.ts
msgid "Your merge is saved locally; Retry to send it once the remote settles."
msgstr "合并已保存在本地；待远程仓库稳定后重试即可发送。"
